{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは、渡辺です〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/24/1171722/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マーマはずっとこの画像を\nネギを持ってると思っていたみたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"菜の花です（＾Ｏ＾）←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマが花なんだよて言うているのに\nなぜ私だけネギ持たすねんて\n何言ってるんでしょうね私の母"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ心配になってきましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BRODY発売中です。2期生集合。\nまだ見てない方はぜひ見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば！2月10日に上げた\nブログのなかでおばあちゃんの話を\nしたのですが、、\nなんとそのおばあちゃんにまた\nお会いしたのです(o_o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもまたバスの中で‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お「あなたあれよね！？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「え、あ、あ...あ、はい！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お「ごめんね〜今日パンないのよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「全然大丈夫ですよ、こないだ頂いた\nパン凄く美味しかったです」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お「あらそう？良かったわ\nあ、じゃあパン代わりとして\nこれあげるから何か買ってね」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「！？...200円なんて頂けないです...\nパンとかならまだ受け取れるんですけど\nさすがにこれは......」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お「あなた私の孫に似てて可愛いのよ〜\nたぶん年齢も同じくらいで顔も似てて...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「何歳なんですか？(^ ^)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お「21歳よ〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「ほ、ほお(^ ^)女の子なんですね！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お「いえ、男の子よ〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「ほ、ほお(^ ^)さようですか...(^ ^)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21歳と思われててしかも21歳の男性に\n顔がそっくりなんだそうです...\nなんてこった.........(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は16歳の女の子ですよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあと結局200円も丁寧に\nお断りしてちゃんと返しました！\nハチャメチャな会話だけど\n話してても凄く優しいおばあちゃんで\n出会えて良かったなと思ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/24/1171722/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の逆質問"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のルーティーンは何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！\n多かったコメントベスト5は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.ブログを見る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.乃木坂の曲を聴くこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.靴や靴下の履く順番"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.毎日牛乳(コーヒー、水)を飲む"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5.朝起きたら背伸びをする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした( ´  ` )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もちなみに朝起きたら背伸びを\nするようにしています。\nなぜかって？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身長を少しでも伸ばすためだなんて\n言えません(^ ^)(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の逆質問は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂を好きになったきっかけは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂が誕生日を迎えたにちなんで\nこの質問にしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひコメントお待ちしております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆質問楽しい！というコメントが\n多くてとても嬉しいです(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月誕生日の方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/24/1171722/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/24/1171722/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみさん、高山さん、ちはるさん、\n万理華さん、橋本さん\nお誕生日おめでとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎質問返し◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛のお気に入りの場所はどこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→自分の部屋とあと他にも\nいろいろあるんだけど秘密〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他は〇〇駅の近くのどこどこ〜とか\nそんな感じなんだもの(/ _ ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・寝る前にやることってある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→音楽を聴くことかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ついついやってしまうくせは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→髪の毛をさわる\n食べた後美味しかったら必ず声を出す"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり自分のくせって分からない(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・バスとか電車に乗ってる時に\n席が空いていたらそのまま立ってる派？\n座る派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→時と場合によります..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に足がもたなかったりする時は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"座ってしまいますが、\n基本は立っているようにしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2016/02/24/1171722/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の土日は京都にて全国と個握！\nお待ちしてます〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}